# AgencyFlow web client — build-time environment TEMPLATE
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the JavaScript bundle at
# BUILD time. Two consequences that matter:
#
#   1. Nothing here may ever be secret. It ships to the browser in plain text.
#   2. Changing a value requires a rebuild, not a restart. On Vercel, edit the
#      variable and then redeploy.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API origin
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leave UNSET for local development: the Vite dev server proxies /api and
# /health to localhost:3000, so relative paths are correct and same-origin.
#
# Required in production, where the client (Vercel) and the API (Railway) are
# different origins. No trailing slash.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://agencyflow-api.up.railway.app
